	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Das Jahr ergibt sich zweifelsfrei aus den im Brief übermittelten Nachrichten. Ferner wird hier auf <persName ref="p495" cert="high">Bullingers</persName> Brief vom 26. August 1545 (oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>) Bezug genommen.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Heri per vestrum tabellionem<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt; derselbe wie oben <ref target="file12274">Nr. 2227</ref>, 98. 111.</note> pluribus ad te de nostris et communibus rebus<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Im Brief oben <ref target="file12274">Nr. 2227</ref> vom 27. August 1545.</note>.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Gratiam habeo pro epistola<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist der Brief <persName ref="p8041">Johannes a Lascos</persName> an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> vom 23. Juni 1545, den <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> am 26. August 1545 an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> geschickt hatte; s. oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>, 5f.</note>, quam tamen meo quodam in te tuaque<pb type="edition" next="493"/> iure <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>describendam etiamnum retineo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Certissime per nostrum <persName ref="p7175">Mattheum</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p5856">Matthäus Molckenpur</persName>, der Anfang September zur Vermittlung zwischen den <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkaldenern</placeName> und den <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossen</placeName> nach <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> entsandt wurde; s. oben <ref target="file12274">Nr. 2227</ref>, Anm. 4.</note> hanc <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>missurus aut certe per nobilem ac piam fęminam <persName ref="p7880">a Zimmern</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="6"><persName ref="p7880">Katharina von Zimmern</persName>, geb. 1478 in <placeName ref="l2200">Meßkirch</placeName> (<placeName ref="l3218">Kr. Sigmaringen</placeName>), gest. 17. August 1547 in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>. 1494 Gelübde im <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Fraumünster, 1496 Äbtissin. Sie schloss sich der Reformation unter <persName ref="p4091">Zwingli</persName> an und übergab am 7. Dezember 1524 das Kloster an die Stadt <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>. 1525 Heirat mit <persName ref="p7726">Eberhard von Reischach</persName> (gest. 1531). Von 1540 bis zu ihrem Tod lebte <persName ref="p7880">von Zimmern</persName> in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>. - Lit.: Zürichs letzte Äbtissin Katharina von Zimmern 1478-1547, hg. v. Irene Gysel und Barbara Helbling, Zürich 1999 (mit weiterer Lit.).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quę ultima huius<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Am 31. August 1545.</note> istuc rursum proficiscetur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Puto enim tantisper per <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te, dum per alterutrum accipias, carere illa nulla incommoditate posse.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Descriptio nemini fuerit fraudi, nam mihi uni servabo.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Gustus et huius<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Zu ergänzen: epistolae; s. oben Anm. 4.</note> et libelli<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8041">A Lascos</persName> "Defensio verae doctrinae", die <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> auch an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> versandt hatte; s. oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref> und Anm. 7.</note> maximopere mihi probatur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nondum enim totum evolvi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Quod de <persName ref="p8472">Curione</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p8472">Konrad Hofherr</persName>.</note> tam sollicitus es, maximam habeo gratiam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Sic enim tuo beneficio fore spero, ut expectationi nostrę respondeat<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Zu <persName ref="p8472">Hofherr</persName> s. zuletzt oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>, 8f.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/><persName ref="p8412">Megandrum</persName> vestrum ecclesię alieno profecto tempore ereptum non <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>possum non vehementer dolere<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName> war am 17. August 1545 verstorben; s. oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>, 10-12.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Accipit ille quidem nunc a pastorum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>principe Christo immarcescibilem glorię coronam,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Petr 5, 4</ref></cit>.</note> in gaudia domini sui <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>admissus<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 25, 21. 23</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Interim vero ecclesia tam boni pastoris cura haud absque <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>magna iactura destituitur in tanta praesertim fidelium ministrorum penuria.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Audio <persName ref="p8412">Megandrum</persName> ob hanc praecipue caussam a multis odio habitum, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quod in licentiorem vitam vehementius invexerit et severiorem discipli<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nam praeter cęteros urserit; quę res tamen<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">tamen <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> illi ab omnibus bonis laudi tribuetur<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Vgl. <bibl source="b457">NDB</bibl> XVI 610.</note>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Dominus in huius locum alium dignum istac dispensatione mysteriorum suorum<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 4, 1</ref></cit>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quam primum sufficiat<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Nachfolger wurde <persName ref="p473">Heinrich Buchter</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>, Anm. 12.</note>!</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Comitiorum<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Der Reichstag zu <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName>.</note> exitus talis fuit, ut nihil sit, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quod de illis scribere liceat.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Omnia in aliis comitiis ad calendas ianuarii,<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Nämlich am Reichstag zu <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName>, der für den 6. Januar 1546 einberufen war; s. oben <ref target="file12258">Nr. 2211</ref>, Anm. 24.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quę in istis orsa sunt, pertexentur pari, non dubito, felicitate.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/><persName ref="p5856">Matthęus</persName> noster de iis tibi plura (quandoquidem alter legatus nostrorum fuit<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Zusammen mit <persName ref="p5571">Ludwig Kürnstaller</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file12193">Nr. 2146</ref>, Anm. 26.</note>) <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>non illubenter narraverit.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Sed cave illi dicas me tibi scripsisse,<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Vgl. schon oben <ref target="file12274">Nr. 2227</ref>, 22-35.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quod istic propediem futurus fuerit, etc.<pb type="edition" next="494"/></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Bonum hunc virum<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Wohl <persName ref="p5042">Thomas Grunder</persName>, der <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief (<ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>), den <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> hier beantwortet, überbracht hatte, zumal in <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief auch <persName ref="p5042">Grunders</persName> Rückreise angekündigt war; s. oben <ref target="file12273">Nr. 2226</ref>,5.</note>, quam possum, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tibi commendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salveat tua domus cum omnibus fratribus et amicis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Vestris apud dominum patrociniis perpetuo iuvari et peto et spero.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">28. augusti<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambr. Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> nostrum<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> et accuratissime saluta <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et molarum admone<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Zur Mühlenskizze <persName ref="p8516">Gerhard Westerburgs</persName> s. oben <ref target="file12274">Nr. 2227</ref>, Anm. 60 und unten <ref target="file12287">Nr. 2240</ref>, Anm. 30.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName> suo.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
